-- test: the host calls `handle` for every request with no fact about it, so a `requires` on `handle` is a precondition nothing establishes: U7008 at the `serve` section's module (spec/31 §7, ADR 0123 rule 16)
-- spec: spec/31 §7
-- expect: error U7008 at ita.una:10:10
module srv

import std.host (Reply, Request)

--- Answers every request with a body.
pub handle(request: internal Request) -> internal Reply
  requires request.body != ""
=
  Reply(status: 200, headers: [], body: request.body)
